- ## gastronomy, galilei
+ ## gastronomy, galilei

- - `gastronomy.checksum` is now `extension [source](source: source) def checksum[hash <:
+ - `gastronomy.checksum` теперь — это `extension [source](source: source) def checksum[hash <:

-   Algorithm](using checksummable: (source is Checksummable)^, hashed: Hash in hash, erased
+   Algorithm](using checksummable: (source is Checksummable)^, hashed: Hash in hash, erased

-   weakness: Permit[HashWeakness[hash]]): Digest in hash`, over the new typeclass
-   `gastronomy.Checksummable` (`def checksum(digestion: Digestion^, value: Self): Unit`), where
-   before it was `extension [source: Streamable by Data over Credit](source: source) def
-   checksum[hash <: Algorithm](using Hash in hash, erased Permit[HashWeakness[hash]])`. Every
-   `Streamable by Data over Credit` source still checksums identically, through
-   `Checksummable.streamable`. galilei's `Platform.pathChecksummable` makes any `Path on
-   <platform>` checksummable (a file by its bytes; a directory by its regular files in
-   relative-path order, each as length-prefixed relative path and content; it takes the
-   `DereferenceSymlinks` in scope and raises `Io.Error`), so `path.checksum[Sha2[256]]`, which
-   did not compile, now does. (#2359)
+   weakness: Permit[HashWeakness[hash]]): Digest in hash` поверх нового класса типов
+   `gastronomy.Checksummable` (`def checksum(digestion: Digestion^, value: Self): Unit`), тогда
+   как раньше это было `extension [source: Streamable by Data over Credit](source: source) def
+   checksum[hash <: Algorithm](using Hash in hash, erased Permit[HashWeakness[hash]])`. Любой
+   источник `Streamable by Data over Credit` по-прежнему даёт ту же контрольную сумму через
